#: src/index.js:113
msgid "Used by Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky, Threads, and Reddit. Facebook and LinkedIn read the title from the page Open Graph metadata."
msgstr "Wird von Native Share, WhatsApp, E-Mail, Telegram, X, Bluesky, Threads und Reddit verwendet. Facebook und LinkedIn lesen den Titel von der Seite Open Graph Metadaten."

